 Location: Lancaster\, United Kingdom\nTopics: Computer Vision & Pattern R
 ecognition\, Machine Learning\, Deep Representation Learning\nSize: L\nSu
 bmission type: Paper-based / BMVA proceedings\nConfidence: confirmed\nLas
 t checked date: 2026-10-07\nNotes: Official BMVA pages confirm Lancaster 
